        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer the majority of our solutions on a software-as-a-service subscription model to our customers.",
        "start_character": 2423,
        "end_character": 2525
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As prospective customers evaluate SafePointe, we believe they recognize its differentiated value proposition as a screening solution designed to enable continuous flow of people without traditional checkpoints.",
        "start_character": 39302,
        "end_character": 39512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on initial results, we are developing a more structured cross-sell program designed to generate incremental pipeline within our installed base.",
        "start_character": 41788,
        "end_character": 41937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because we design our networks with a certain amount of redundancy to ensure durability, in our sensor arrays, multiple sensors can be offline at any given time without affecting the overall performance of the system.",
        "start_character": 16236,
        "end_character": 16453
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we engage in research and development activities with manufacturing partners and outsource certain activities to engineering firms to further supplement our internal team.",
        "start_character": 57911,
        "end_character": 58095
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Throughout 2025, we aligned marketing and sales resources to support entry and pipeline development.",
        "start_character": 43606,
        "end_character": 43706
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to developing comprehensive, respectful and engaged partnerships with law enforcement agencies, elected officials and communities focused on making a positive difference in the world.",
        "start_character": 3885,
        "end_character": 4085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are continually investing in our global workforce to further drive diversity and inclusion, provide fair and competitive pay and benefits to support our employees’ well-being, and to foster the growth and development of all employees.",
        "start_character": 66188,
        "end_character": 66425
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are expanding our capabilities in AI-driven investigative and operational intelligence initially through CrimeTracer Gen3, which is a major upgrade to CrimeTracer designed to help agencies more efficiently analyze and act on growing volumes of public safety data.",
        "start_character": 40309,
        "end_character": 40575
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe there is an opportunity to bring a complete digital case management solution to the market to help improve clearance rates of all crime types and accelerate solvability under the SoundThinking brand and sell to both our installed base and new potential customers, such as prisons.",
        "start_character": 28854,
        "end_character": 29145
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-132104",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-132104-cba4a6066be61b36",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-132104",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We focus our research and development efforts on enhancing our advanced signal processing and classification algorithms, updating our sensor hardware technology, reducing manufacturing costs, developing mobile, web and desktop applications, evolving our cloud-deployed back-end infrastructure and integration with “smart cities” initiatives.",
